{"id":"caotica-tmdb-1770159","type":"MOVIE","category":"STREAMING","title":"Caótica","overview":"A sus 21 años, Mariana experimenta el día a día a través de la intensidad del Trastorno Límite de la Personalidad (TLP), un motor interno que convierte cada emoción en un incendio forestal. Entre risas fingidas con sus amigos, una relación destructiva marcada por el terror al abandono y las secuelas de una infancia herida, su mente opera al límite entre el vacío constante y la autodestrucción. Una inmersión directa en su caótica perspectiva donde cada reacción extrema expone lo que significa vivir al filo de una mente que quema todo a su paso.","releaseDate":"2026-09-11","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f68l8mYVCS59qsAgUOlkDiFK7VD.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wXVfBf3yVYiQpJRWCPP8Sav1WnT.jpg","genres":["Drama"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wXVfBf3yVYiQpJRWCPP8Sav1WnT.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1Fnb4KbaDoIzWJACGH60gXGlZ15.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lQ9XLK57JAThnRbT5oTcucFg33X.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zBojmUdlUwu6yCmhGCSXicwuMIp.jpg","label":"Escena 04"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Natasha Cubría","role":"Mariana","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6q8aliQWdsiTqTuR0WFy8fE93Ig.jpg","personTmdbId":1892939,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Abigail Nicoletto","role":"Psicóloga","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxt3fM2AwCUEUWq8Vhy4KxXf7GL.jpg","personTmdbId":3464777,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Antonio Peralta","role":"Francisco","personTmdbId":6477367,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Andrés Jahir","role":"Javier","personTmdbId":6477373,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Nora Andrea","role":"Daniela","personTmdbId":6477375,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Regina Morgan","role":"Mariana Niña","personTmdbId":647737